		{"id":"1b94fd3f1c1dfcc2","type":"text","text":"2. She said she got the fuse","x":2117,"y":476,"width":254,"height":59},
		{"id":"1800e698f5aa1833","type":"text","text":"3. But instead of being met with hapiness, she was met with her father's fury","x":2087,"y":570,"width":373,"height":50},
		{"id":"a9de3ed3b599a01c","type":"text","text":"4. She explained that she had came home just find","x":2118,"y":665,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"34a60ade58a3123a","type":"text","text":"5. Her father calmed down","x":2085,"y":741,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"cda4183fe2fbfbbc","type":"text","text":"6. But Merchant said that it's impossible either way, and there is no hope","x":2085,"y":840,"width":286,"height":97},
		{"id":"e5e127f7f6854d41","type":"text","text":"7. Kenari learnt hopelessness","x":2117,"y":967,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"db161d6c0d5b4ead","type":"text","text":"Merchant","x":1661,"y":310,"width":250,"height":59,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"beb99e29a98b7625","type":"text","text":"1. Merchant is talking to Father who is really worried of his daughter ","x":1661,"y":439,"width":319,"height":50},
		{"id":"2acd9ff5d5bdec0d","type":"text","text":"2. Just in time, Kenari came","x":1672,"y":504,"width":250,"height":60},
