		{"id":"73034cfaf7a65bc2","type":"text","text":"4. Merchant tries to mediate.","x":1673,"y":694,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"392009738c25e551","type":"text","text":"5. They calmed down","x":1640,"y":770,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b8242f50016e09a0","type":"text","text":"6. But the reality still stands, they couldn't do anything","x":1663,"y":869,"width":317,"height":68},
		{"id":"4e03294324dce4bf","type":"text","text":"7. Merchant must see another person die","x":1676,"y":951,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d4e08e6ad7e16759","type":"text","text":"1. Father is talking to Merchant about his missing daughter","x":1241,"y":420,"width":319,"height":56},
		{"id":"de80e48b4ffe56e6","type":"text","text":"2. Merchant calmed him down, saying that she might be in the annual check-up. She will be back.","x":1252,"y":489,"width":308,"height":130},
