		{"id":"c9a9fdf6486b795e","type":"text","text":"4. Father lectures Kenari, on how dangerous what she did is, and he is worried about her.","x":1278,"y":720,"width":250,"height":120},
		{"id":"7656e50875713b3e","type":"text","text":"5. Kenari eventually understand, he is just glad she came back safelt","x":1240,"y":873,"width":250,"height":108},
		{"id":"6c09eb26eaf9ff67","type":"text","text":"6. But his daughter is still determined to do more risky things just to save him. And Merchant is still talking about it","x":1263,"y":1011,"width":250,"height":149},
		{"id":"7a76433945876f18","type":"text","text":"7. He learnt that there is no stopping a desperate person","x":1263,"y":1180,"width":250,"height":100},
