		{"id":"994b6c41dcc547d9","type":"text","text":"Merchant","x":3893,"y":-1026,"width":250,"height":59,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bb664786a4717744","type":"text","text":"Kenari","x":4338,"y":-1040,"width":250,"height":59,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d3827779731059b8","type":"text","text":"Father","x":3475,"y":-1040,"width":250,"height":59,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"802f956f6992c8f8","x":3893,"y":-770,"width":467,"height":64,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"\"It's been weeks... My neighbour said she was last seen here at your Shop. Have you seen her?\""},
		{"id":"2789051ef9565c55","x":3780,"y":-760,"width":53,"height":53,"type":"text","text":"1"},
		{"id":"89238161d4d2f6ad","type":"text","text":"2","x":3780,"y":-669,"width":53,"height":53},
		{"id":"c0d461c1caea07d8","type":"text","text":"3","x":3780,"y":-567,"width":53,"height":53},
		{"id":"ce6d224310cd1142","type":"text","text":"4","x":3780,"y":-448,"width":53,"height":53},
		{"id":"f8938fac0e14b279","type":"text","text":"5","x":3780,"y":-340,"width":53,"height":53},
		{"id":"dc504418f20c0ca8","type":"text","text":"6","x":3780,"y":-227,"width":53,"height":53},
		{"id":"423097cc40512ae8","type":"text","text":"7","x":3780,"y":-136,"width":53,"height":53},
		{"id":"8cabeb90df64c46b","type":"text","text":"8","x":3780,"y":-34,"width":53,"height":53},
		{"id":"91418f9ecb407ca4","type":"text","text":"9","x":3780,"y":85,"width":53,"height":53},
		{"id":"625fe85faff48cbd","type":"text","text":"14","x":3780,"y":650,"width":80,"height":53},
		{"id":"fefca1a4bb32eb89","type":"text","text":"15","x":3780,"y":758,"width":80,"height":53},
		{"id":"ff11e50b8b887b49","type":"text","text":"16","x":3780,"y":871,"width":80,"height":53},
		{"id":"e44b4287acf338c5","type":"text","text":"17","x":3780,"y":962,"width":80,"height":53},
		{"id":"d3dbac9a475a9f6a","type":"text","text":"18","x":3780,"y":1064,"width":80,"height":53},
		{"id":"62aaf44911ce202e","type":"text","text":"19","x":3780,"y":1183,"width":80,"height":53},
		{"id":"6f19c0e60d68d4cf","type":"text","text":"20","x":3780,"y":1280,"width":80,"height":53},
		{"id":"4f961a69426a04f2","type":"text","text":"11","x":3780,"y":338,"width":80,"height":53},
		{"id":"937aaba05d60ac50","type":"text","text":"13","x":3780,"y":531,"width":80,"height":53},
		{"id":"a6d912a5e5e27dba","type":"text","text":"12","x":3780,"y":429,"width":80,"height":53},
		{"id":"7beaa1dacd1590bb","type":"text","text":"10","x":3780,"y":202,"width":80,"height":58},
		{"id":"6cf70eec004378e7","x":3920,"y":702,"width":611,"height":114,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"Can I restore it? Technically, yes. Realistically? No. Not unless you'd like seeing me full of holes like cheddar cheese by the morning. The Troopers guard the Solar Panel like rabid dogs, and I’d rather not become their chew toy. Until someone drives them off, restoring the power is impossible."},
		{"id":"26fe2cf735a13075","x":3920,"y":840,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3","type":"text","text":"But his pacemaker is losing power, without it he will-"},
		{"id":"ae272d889da04b28","x":3920,"y":943,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"Kenari! Just stop it. Please."},
		{"id":"26cb986b488341ab","x":3920,"y":1157,"width":411,"height":60,"color":"3","type":"text","text":"And do you think i want to lose you too?! I have to do this. I can't lose you!"},
		{"id":"c421f9ca58e075db","x":3920,"y":1045,"width":389,"height":78,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"Your mother's gone. You are what i have left... I don't want to lose you."},
		{"id":"ac11d8efc2a3d81f","x":3920,"y":1260,"width":611,"height":84,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"Kenari, your father has a point. The fuse is a start. But the Solar Panel require three more of these. And unless you’ve got a small army of daredevils, I don’t know anyone who’d tempt fate getting all three."},
		{"id":"c45aa0c3f45bdf8d","x":4531,"y":702,"width":701,"height":114,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"If it were as simple as flipping a switch I’d have done it weeks ago, Kenari. I may know a thing or two, And I’m not keen on getting riddled with holes like a cheap Cheddar Cheese by the morning. The pacemaker needs power, I understand. But I cannot fix the Solar Panel with the Troopers lurking about."},
		{"id":"f06974212c3615ca","type":"text","text":"Running off just for a piece of scrap outside the walls, what were you thinking?!","x":3920,"y":170,"width":250,"height":91,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0d06d0b4c78e0a59","x":3920,"y":263,"width":389,"height":123,"color":"3","type":"text","text":"You have been getting weaker by the day, Dad! Your pacemaker is losing power, I had to restore the power for you to get better!"},
		{"id":"cd6a81653fe88493","type":"text","text":"The Merchant's right! WIth the Fuse we can get the electricity back to the Solar Panel!... Can you do it, Mr. Merchant?","x":3920,"y":608,"width":389,"height":85,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"049f5cd62a51df67","x":3920,"y":413,"width":389,"height":57,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"You reckless girl... Don't you know that you could've been in danger?!"},
		{"id":"25a69f4f94f7592b","x":3920,"y":487,"width":438,"height":85,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"Now, now… let’s not have a shouting match in my store, shall we? Your daughter is here with us now, that is all that matter."},
		{"id":"c540798abb980fe4","x":3920,"y":-173,"width":250,"height":105,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"There she is, Kenari! Your father has been sweating bullets looking for you!"},
		{"id":"4cd600506ba4de77","x":3920,"y":-65,"width":250,"height":126,"color":"3","type":"text","text":"Dad! I got the fuze! now we can restore the electricity back and charge your pacemaker!"},
		{"id":"23e7a8ffface6731","x":3920,"y":61,"width":250,"height":109,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"Kenari! Do you have any idea what you’ve put me through?! You’ve been gone for weeks!"},
		{"id":"ad727d6d2e32bdd6","x":3893,"y":-669,"width":532,"height":53,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"They’re right. She came by a few weeks back. Asked me questions about the power going down."},
		{"id":"39e4ad68eb36fd34","x":3893,"y":-574,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"What did you say to her?"},
		{"id":"4369d796f333ada2","x":3882,"y":-460,"width":738,"height":78,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"Said that I couldn’t. She asked me for another way, I told her there was none. She’s a bright one, your Kenari, but stubborn as any I’ve met, we talked for hours that day."},
		{"id":"70bfd4c57e6fabed","x":3882,"y":-347,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"Then where is she now?"},
		{"id":"581b6be2acf5d08f","type":"text","text":"You worry too much! She will be back like she always does! ","x":3882,"y":-266,"width":327,"height":88,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"857a4db68fdc3953","type":"text","text":"1","x":5360,"y":-732,"width":53,"height":53},
		{"id":"f37176f8774881b9","type":"text","text":"2","x":5360,"y":-641,"width":53,"height":53},
