		{"id":"ebc5a326e6ced923","type":"text","text":"10","x":5360,"y":230,"width":80,"height":58},
		{"id":"6d2a0a163f3b6dca","type":"text","text":"Can I restore it? Technically, yes. Realistically? No. Not unless you'd like seeing me full of holes like cheddar cheese by the morning. The Troopers guard the Solar Panel like rabid dogs, and I’d rather not become their chew toy. Until someone drives them off, restoring the power is impossible.","x":5480,"y":115,"width":611,"height":114,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"6f7434fe401ac7e2","type":"text","text":"But his pacemaker is losing power, without it he will-","x":5480,"y":253,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"562b8c511912ddb1","type":"text","text":"Kenari! Just stop it. Please.","x":5480,"y":356,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"25c4edb57433f281","type":"text","text":"And do you think i want to lose you too?! I have to do this. I can't lose you!","x":5480,"y":570,"width":411,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d23537bb1fd333c4","type":"text","text":"Your mother's gone. You are what i have left... I don't want to lose you.","x":5480,"y":458,"width":389,"height":78,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6352dfb66aa3f0dc","type":"text","text":"If it were as simple as flipping a switch I’d have done it weeks ago, Kenari. I may know a thing or two, And I’m not keen on getting riddled with holes like a cheap Cheddar Cheese by the morning. The pacemaker needs power, I understand. But I cannot fix the Solar Panel with the Troopers lurking about.","x":6091,"y":115,"width":701,"height":114,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"929d2bfd99aca592","type":"text","text":"Running off just for a piece of scrap outside the walls, what were you thinking?!","x":5480,"y":-417,"width":250,"height":91,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"7a692009f8d456ef","type":"text","text":"You have been getting weaker by the day, Dad! Your pacemaker is losing power, I had to restore the power for you to get better!","x":5480,"y":-324,"width":389,"height":123,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"cb9727a332f36633","type":"text","text":"The Merchant's right! WIth the Fuse we can get the electricity back to the Solar Panel!... Can you do it, Mr. Merchant?","x":5480,"y":21,"width":389,"height":85,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"dd9e7453f8d8d34b","type":"text","text":"You reckless girl... Don't you know that you could've been in danger?!","x":5480,"y":-174,"width":389,"height":57,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2d46e2743aae2a4d","type":"text","text":"Now, now… let’s not have a shouting match in my store, shall we? Your daughter is here with us now, that is all that matter.","x":5480,"y":-100,"width":438,"height":85,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2351a7692568ab90","type":"text","text":"There she is, Kenari! Your father has been sweating bullets looking for you!","x":5480,"y":-760,"width":250,"height":105,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"07dfb311f02c5e48","type":"text","text":"Dad! I got the fuze! now we can restore the electricity back and charge your pacemaker!","x":5480,"y":-652,"width":250,"height":126,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c2b4d99b5778642a","type":"text","text":"Kenari! Do you have any idea what you’ve put me through?! You’ve been gone for weeks!","x":5480,"y":-526,"width":250,"height":109,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ee0b4add66a13558","type":"text","text":"Kenari, your father has a point. The fuse is a start. But the Solar Panel require three more of these. And unless you’ve got a small army of daredevils, I don’t know anyone who’d tempt fate getting all three.","x":5500,"y":663,"width":611,"height":84,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a4dbf0cda539e33c","type":"text","text":"I- I don't want him gone....","x":5525,"y":786,"width":411,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"23521b3d018a3861","x":5500,"y":872,"width":942,"height":118,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"I understand, but If you run out there with nothing but your stubborn will, your father won’t be saved. he’ll be mourning you. Opportunities have a way of presenting themselves, Kenari. We just have to be patient about this."},
		{"id":"4597761714ac548a","x":6147,"y":-778,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Why? Shows charisma"},
		{"id":"3808cb4db5a95d9d","x":6115,"y":-675,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Shows Kenari Determination"},
		{"id":"097d00d27820c80b","type":"text","text":"Father","x":5375,"y":-1349,"width":250,"height":59,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"883605cddd2eeef5","type":"text","text":"Kenari","x":6466,"y":-1349,"width":250,"height":59,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"8fad0db8dca380e3","type":"text","text":"Merchant","x":5926,"y":-1349,"width":250,"height":59,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b79956e7746f999e","type":"text","text":"Character: Caring, Protective","x":5375,"y":-1269,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0ca4d2b5418e8c23","type":"text","text":"Character: Cheerful, Street-smart","x":5926,"y":-1269,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"baf35518304484f1","type":"text","text":"Character: Desperate, Destermined","x":6466,"y":-1269,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3baee3e96e0f4b69","type":"text","text":"Goal: To let Kenari know what she is doing is dangerous","x":5375,"y":-1189,"width":250,"height":80},
		{"id":"298e873594fef8ff","type":"text","text":"Goal: To let kenari understand that what she wanted is Impossible","x":5926,"y":-1189,"width":250,"height":110},
		{"id":"72125b0004126471","type":"text","text":"Goal: To get someone to act about her father's failing pacemaker.","x":6466,"y":-1189,"width":250,"height":110},
		{"id":"381a53f45df284e9","type":"text","text":"Child","x":6466,"y":-1414,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1d2877fe7cab6276","type":"text","text":"Adult","x":5926,"y":-1414,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"10a8c6818087748d","type":"text","text":"Parent","x":5375,"y":-1444,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a796fb9910f0751e","type":"text","text":"Obstacle: Her father's worry and Merchant's sitrep","x":6466,"y":-1049,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"60824db260ef4d77","type":"text","text":"Obstacle: Kenari's desperation","x":5926,"y":-1049,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f298df95fce6bfcd","type":"text","text":"Obstacle: Kenari's desperation.","x":5375,"y":-1079,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a70f3cbcf74cc1d6","type":"text","text":"Character: Tries to lighten-up the mood during intense situation","x":5926,"y":-957,"width":250,"height":115},
		{"id":"46c98bb7d65bb209","type":"text","text":"Character: Determined, wanting to save her father and do the Impossible.","x":6466,"y":-957,"width":250,"height":96},
		{"id":"4882ea133d98fae1","type":"text","text":"Character: Tries to speak, fighting his own tiredness to say his worry for Kenari","x":5375,"y":-989,"width":250,"height":102},
		{"id":"171e54c29ae25988","x":6676,"y":-285,"width":50,"height":63,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"5"},
